      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not explicitly define what “vocational services” are (e.g., as supports aimed at helping people get and keep employment); it only mentions that offenders with mental illness are excluded from vocational services.",
        "The definition’s claim that employment is linked with “better mental health and social connection” is only partially supported: the packet states employment improves mental health and “connect[ing] people to society,” but it does not support the full phrasing or the full causal framing as presented."
